			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701140101,
					"content": "It's a rare occasion indeed when Miss Sandrone finds the time to visit Mondstadt.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140102,
					"content": "You provided such invaluable help when I was researching the numerological array. I wanted to thank you in person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140103,
					"content": "You're too kind. But such things lie well outside my area of expertise. The credit for completing it should really be all yours.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140104,
					"content": "It was a team effort. Hmm... Come to think of it, where's Durin? Seeing as you're practically his guardian, I thought he would be unable to stray too far from your side.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140105,
					"content": "You're not entirely wrong.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140106,
					"content": "But recently, he's been making headway with his social skills, so I've been trying to encourage him to be a bit more independent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140107,
					"content": "Aren't you worried about him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140108,
					"content": "A little. In the past, if he was on his own and interacting with someone whose personality was... let's say \"strong,\" he tended to...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140109,
					"content": "Pick up bizarre habits? Mimic unusual verbal tics?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140110,
					"content": "Precisely. I take it you've experienced something similar, Miss Sandrone?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140111,
					"content": "Hmph, do you even need to ask? I'm practically an expert...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140112,
					"content": "Typically, after a meeting with Grand Master Varka, I'll take Durin to visit Sucrose and help with her research. It allows him to find his focus.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140113,
					"content": "But if he's spent too long with Acting Grand Master Jean, we'll pay a visit to Klee so he can rediscover how to relax.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140114,
					"content": "Sounds like a lot of work...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140115,
					"content": "Just looking after my family.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140116,
					"content": "How would you handle such situations?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140117,
					"content": "Me? I don't have the energy for that sort of mess...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140118,
					"content": "But it seems to me that if someone's good by nature, no matter how much they're influenced, they'll always return to their true self.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701140119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 701140119,
					"content": "Hmm... An excellent observation. Perhaps I can adopt this way of thinking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Albedo"
				}
			]
		},
